{"chars": "On a big boulder above them sat a snow leopard. Her fur was thick and soft and smoky gray, almost white, and covered in dark rings and spots, like the patterns of shadows on snow. Her tail was enormous, very long and very fluffy, and she had wrapped it around her paws like a scarf. Her paws were big and round and furry, like a pair of snowshoes. And her eyes were pale and clear, like the mountain sky. Around her edges, her fur shimmered and wavered, the way the air shimmers over a warm stone. She was not an ordinary snow leopard. She was the guardian of the Ice Orchid.", "start": [0.225, 0.225, 0.338, 0.338, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.4, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.625, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.25, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.45, 1.663, 1.663, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 1.775, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.125, 2.85, 2.95, 2.95, 2.95, 2.95, 3.112, 3.112, 3.112, 3.112, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.4, 3.612, 3.612, 3.612, 3.612, 3.612, 3.612, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 3.9, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.075, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.463, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 4.612, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.05, 5.525, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.037, 6.575, 6.65, 6.65, 6.65, 6.65, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 7.1, 7.1, 7.1, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.25, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.575, 7.862, 7.862, 7.862, 7.862, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 7.987, 8.55, 8.625, 8.625, 8.625, 8.625, 8.625, 8.762, 8.762, 8.762, 8.762, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 8.85, 9.213, 9.213, 9.213, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.338, 9.713, 9.713, 9.713, 9.887, 9.887, 9.887, 9.887, 9.887, 10.625, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.75, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 10.9, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.2, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 11.35, 12.0, 12.1, 12.1, 12.1, 12.1, 12.1, 12.375, 12.375, 12.375, 12.375, 12